@display("std/apis")
apis: part {
  | The interface the transports built into `heron` implement, and the kind a package declares a transport with.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/apis/package.heron`, whose types the API reference renders.
  | `Transport`, `Response` and `transport` are specified in [Transports](#language.apis.transports.transport_binding),
  | and `@server` in [RPC bindings](#language.apis.rpc.server_url).
}
